cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "OPERATE: Benchmarking Persistent Operational Agency in Source-Grounded Executable Systems"
message: If you use this benchmark, cite the repository and the exact release manifest evaluated.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Xnhyacinth
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/Xnhyacinth/OPERATE
abstract: >-
  OPERATE evaluates LLM agents as persistent operational decision centers
  against source-grounded, code-driven, seeded executable systems. Its primary
  formal treatment is logical_persistent; realtime_persistent is a separate
  formal supervision treatment.
